		"sections": [
			{
				"id": 32198,
				"title": "Overview",
				"body_text": "Reshanor's throat surges with dark, twisted energy, unleashing [Veilshatter Roars] and [Twilight Breaths]. His unstable presence conjures a raging [Voidstorm].\r\n\r\nWhen his energy wanes, Reshanor retreats into Untethered Space to feed on arcane forces - tearing open reality and allowing void creatures to spill forth.",
				"sections": [
					{
						"id": 32199,
						"title": "Healers",
						"body_text": "$bullet;[Veilshatter Roar] inflicts heavy damage to all players and interrupts those casting.\r\n$bullet;[Erratic Rifts] allow players to follow Reshanor into Untethered Space.\r\n$bullet; Players with high stacks of [Void Corruption] require significant healing."
					},
					{
						"id": 32200,
						"title": "Tanks",
						"body_text": "$bullet;[Veilshatter Roar] inflicts heavy damage to all players and interrupts those casting.\r\n$bullet;[Erratic Rifts] allow players to follow Reshanor into Untethered Space.\r\n$bullet; Void creatures are called during [Untethered Retreat]."
					},
